// Alabama's own Grade 9 social studies units (`al-` ids), for World History and Geography: Age of Revolution to
// Present: the French Revolution and Napoleon (9.2), the Industrial Revolution (9.4), nationalism (9.5), imperialism
// (9.6), World War I (9.7), the interwar years (9.8, 9.9), World War II (9.10, 9.12), the Holocaust (9.11), the Cold
// War (9.13, 9.15), decolonization (9.14), the world since 1990 (9.16 to 9.18) and a timeline of the whole course.
// The Holocaust is told plainly and respectfully, as the state-sponsored murder of Europe's Jews and other victims.

